- **Import path:** From SDK 56, Expo Router no longer supports importing from `@react-navigation/*` in app code. Use `expo-router/react-navigation`, as above. On SDK 55 or earlier, import `ThemeProvider`, `DarkTheme` and `DefaultTheme` from `@react-navigation/native`. The Expo migration guide includes a codemod, `npx expo-codemod sdk-56-expo-router-react-navigation-replace src`.
