**Rules that keep it safe:**
- Import from `$env/static/private` (build-time) or `$env/dynamic/private` (runtime) only in server-only code: `+page.server.js`, `+layout.server.js`, `+server.js`, `hooks.server.js`, or anything under `$lib/server/`.
